.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
.Dd July 29, 2026
.Dt NETMAPD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm netmapd
.Nd restricted netmap bearer service
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is installed only in
.Pa /Capabilities/System/Netmapd.cap .
It is the sole base component with authority to open and register netmap
ports for userspace network stacks.
.Pp
The initial policy permits only explicitly named VALE ports and rejects
physical interfaces, host rings, netmap pipes, option injection, multiple
queues, caller-selected buffer sizes, and unknown flags.
The returned descriptor is limited to event polling, read-write mapping,
metadata, and netmap TX/RX synchronization ioctls.
.Pp
Every request and bearer creation has a DTrace probe.
Successful and denied creations are submitted to OpenBSM as
.Dv AUE_NETMAPD_BEARER .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr libnetworkcmp 3 ,
.Xr netmap 4 ,
.Xr cmp 7 ,
.Xr serviced 8
